{"id":24,"modified":"2026-10-17T19:45:13","content":{"raw":"<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro medlux-about-intro\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center medlux-intro medlux-about-intro\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-about-headline\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-about-headline\">Treatment in T\u00fcrkiye.<br><span>Travel wherever you wish.<\/span><\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-lead\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-lead\">MedLuxLife was founded by Anna and Emrah in Aachen, Germany. We bring two things together: medical treatment with qualified specialists at our partner clinics and hospitals in T\u00fcrkiye \u2013 and travel to any destination you choose, whether a holiday, a city break, a business trip or a pilgrimage.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-lead\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-lead\">We adapt to you \u2013 to your wishes, your budget and your schedule. Whatever you have in mind, we look for the comfortable solution that suits you, and one personal contact plans every step with you.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":2048,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro-img medlux-about-founders\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full medlux-intro-img medlux-about-founders\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-team-2026b.jpg\" alt=\"Anna and Emrah, the founders of MedLuxLife, at their office desk\" class=\"wp-image-2048\"\/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Anna &amp; Emrah, founders of MedLuxLife<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:column --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section medlux-about-what-sec\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section medlux-about-what-sec\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What we do<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid medlux-about-what\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid medlux-about-what\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:image {\"className\":\"medlux-card-icon\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-card-icon\"><img src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Health<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We are your coordinator, not a clinic. We listen to your wishes, arrange your consultation with qualified specialists at our partner clinics and hospitals in T\u00fcrkiye and organise your stay. All medical decisions are made by licensed doctors, together with you.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:image {\"className\":\"medlux-card-icon\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-card-icon\"><img src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Travel<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Travel is not limited to T\u00fcrkiye: we plan holidays, city breaks, business trips and pilgrimages to the destination of your choice \u2013 flights, hand-picked hotels, private transfers and excursions, tailored to your wishes and budget.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section medlux-partners\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section medlux-partners\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Our partners<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-partners-quote\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-partners-quote\">We have personally visited the clinics and hospitals we work with in Istanbul. What we would not recommend to our own family, we do not recommend to you.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-partners-label\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-partners-label\">What we look at<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"medlux-criteria\"} -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list medlux-criteria\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Valid licences<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>International accreditation<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Experienced specialists<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Experience with international patients<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<!-- \/wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid medlux-partners-grid\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid medlux-partners-grid\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hospital &amp; specialist care<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-partner-type\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-partner-type\">A large university hospital group in Istanbul<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Several hospitals and specialised centres<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Academic specialists in almost every field<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Modern diagnostics such as 3-Tesla MRI and PET-CT<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>International JCI accreditation<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<!-- \/wp:list --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Aesthetic, hair, dental &amp; weight-loss treatments<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-partner-type\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-partner-type\">A specialised clinic for international patients<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Surgical team with more than 25 years of experience<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Treatments in partner hospitals approved by the Turkish Ministry of Health and accredited by JCI, or at the clinic itself<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Quiet rest areas, for example after a hair transplant<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<!-- \/wp:list --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-partners-note\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-partners-note\">We plan to add further renowned hospitals to our network \u2013 always selected by the same criteria.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-why medlux-why\\u002d\\u002dsix\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-why medlux-why--six\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How we take care of you<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-why-grid\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-why-grid\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-why-item\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-why-item\"><!-- wp:image {\"className\":\"medlux-why-icon\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-why-icon\"><img src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">One personal contact<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>From your first question until you are back home, one person who knows your plan.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-why-item\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-why-item\"><!-- wp:image {\"className\":\"medlux-why-icon\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-why-icon\"><img src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Your language<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We speak Turkish, Ukrainian, Russian, English and German. At our partner clinics, native-speaking interpreters are available for nine languages.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-why-item\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-why-item\"><!-- wp:image {\"className\":\"medlux-why-icon\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-why-icon\"><img src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Clear steps<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Before you decide, we explain the planned steps of your treatment and journey. No obligation.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-why-item\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-why-item\"><!-- wp:image {\"className\":\"medlux-why-icon\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-why-icon\"><img src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Confidential<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your medical documents are shared only in your consultation with the doctor, with your consent, and handled in line with the GDPR.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-why-item\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-why-item\"><!-- wp:image {\"className\":\"medlux-why-icon\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-why-icon\"><img src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Reply within 24 hours<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We answer every enquiry personally within 24 hours.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-why-item\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-why-item\"><!-- wp:image {\"className\":\"medlux-why-icon\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-why-icon\"><img src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">After you are home<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Stay in touch with us on WhatsApp after your return and tell us how you are.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section medlux-values\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section medlux-values\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What we stand for<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-values-words\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-values-words\"><span>Honesty<\/span><span>Care<\/span><span>Discretion<\/span><span>Reliability<\/span><\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These are the values we work by \u2013 with every guest, every partner and every plan.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-cta\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-cta\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Let's plan it together<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tell us what you have in mind \u2013 by phone, WhatsApp or our contact form. The first conversation is free and without obligation.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-primary\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/contact\/\">Request a Free Consultation<\/a><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:button -->\n\n<!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-whatsapp\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-whatsapp\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/380979092326\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp<\/a><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:button --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-disclaimer\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-disclaimer\">[trp_language language=\"en_GB\"]Please note: MedLuxLife does not provide medical treatment itself. Medical services are provided exclusively by licensed doctors and clinics; we act as an intermediary and coordinator. For travel services, we act as an intermediary between you and the respective airlines, hotels and transfer providers.[\/trp_language][trp_language language=\"de_DE\"]Hinweis: MedLuxLife erbringt selbst keine medizinischen Leistungen. Medizinische Leistungen werden ausschlie\u00dflich von zugelassenen \u00c4rztinnen, \u00c4rzten und Kliniken erbracht; wir sind als Vermittler und Koordinator t\u00e4tig. Bei Reiseleistungen handeln wir als Vermittler zwischen Ihnen und den jeweiligen Fluggesellschaften, Hotels und Transferunternehmen.[\/trp_language][trp_language language=\"tr_TR\"]Not: MedLuxLife kendisi t\u0131bbi hizmet sunmaz. T\u0131bbi hizmetler yaln\u0131zca yetkili hekimler ve klinikler taraf\u0131ndan verilir; biz arac\u0131 ve koordinat\u00f6r olarak \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r\u0131z. Seyahat hizmetlerinde ise sizinle ilgili havayolu \u015firketleri, oteller ve transfer firmalar\u0131 aras\u0131nda arac\u0131l\u0131k yapar\u0131z.[\/trp_language]<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n"}}